    <string name="presence_bitmap_upload_toggle">Host bitmap-only covers</string>
    <string name="presence_bitmap_upload_blurb">For players that expose a local image instead of a URL. RP Music compresses and uploads it once per track over an active connection; the link is public. Enabled by default for broad player support. Turn it off to keep local covers private.</string>
