    <string name="custom_cover_upload_notice_body">Discord cannot use an image stored only on your phone. RP Music compresses it and uploads it to Catbox. Anyone with the public link can view it. Uploads associated with your Catbox account are kept with that account; anonymous uploads are removed after two years without views. Player artwork uploads use Wi-Fi only.</string>
